@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Latest CSV saved by the cron (404 until it has run once)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/weekly/latest

### Run the cron by hand: scrape every service and save to Vercel Blob (~1 min, needs BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/weekly/cron
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv CRON_SECRET}}

### Check that scraping ONE still works: PS3 VNCMP → USLAX, 2 weeks (~15s, 503 if no sailings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/healthCheck
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv CRON_SECRET}}

### Result of the last health check (public, instant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/healthCheck/latest

### All default ONE services side by side, one column each (takes ~1 min)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-06",
  "next": 8,
  "services_routes": "all"
}

### Only the services you pick, each searched on its own route
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-06",
  "next": 4,
  "services_routes": {
    "PS3": { "from": "VNCMP", "to": "USLAX" },
    "PS7": { "from": "VNHPH", "to": "USLAX" }
  }
}

### Error: unknown location / invalid "next" → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/weekly
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "next": 3,
  "services_routes": { "PS7": { "from": "VMHPH", "to": "USLAX" } }
}

### ONE schedule — Hai Phong → Los Angeles, PS7, as CSV (takes ~15s)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?from=2026-10-06

### Same schedule as ONE's original xlsx
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?from=2026-10-06&format=xlsx

### Different service lane and a shorter window
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?service=FDR&weeks=4

### Other route — codes outside VNHPH/USLAX need the name as ONE spells it
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?origin=VNSGN&originName=HO CHI MINH CITY, VIETNAM&service=PS7

### Error: unknown service → 404 with the services available on the route
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?service=XX1

### Error: unknown origin without a name → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/one/p2p?origin=CNSHA
